{"id":"mtk-02h-persen-bagian-campur","type":"subbab","subject":"mtk","chapter":"mtk-02","subBab":"mtk-02h","slug":"persen-bagian","tier":"campur","title":"OSN SD · MTK · Sub-bab MTK-02h · Persen dari Bagian","theory":[{"title":"A. Apa itu Persen?","content":"**Persen** (%) artinya **per seratus** (per cent). Lambang **%** menggantikan penyebut **100**.\n\n- 25% = 25/100 = 0,25\n- 1% = 1/100 = 0,01\n- 100% = 100/100 = 1 (utuh / seluruhnya)\n- 50% = 50/100 = 1/2 (setengah)\n- 200% = 200/100 = 2 (dua kali lipat)"},{"title":"B. Dua Pertanyaan Pokok","content":"**Pertanyaan 1 — \"Berapa PERSEN X dari Y?\"**\nRumus: **persen = (X / Y) × 100%**\n\nContoh: 15 dari 60 → (15/60) × 100% = 0,25 × 100% = **25%**.\nContoh: 8 dari 40 → (8/40) × 100% = 0,2 × 100% = **20%**.\n\n**Pertanyaan 2 — \"X% dari Y berapa?\"**\nRumus: **hasil = (X / 100) × Y**\n\nContoh: 30% dari 200 → (30/100) × 200 = 0,3 × 200 = **60**.\nContoh: 15% dari 400 → (15/100) × 400 = 0,15 × 400 = **60**."},{"title":"C. Konversi Cepat (HAFALKAN)","content":"| Pecahan | Desimal | Persen |\n|---------|---------|--------|\n| 1/2 | 0,5 | 50% |\n| 1/4 | 0,25 | 25% |\n| 3/4 | 0,75 | 75% |\n| 1/5 | 0,2 | 20% |\n| 2/5 | 0,4 | 40% |\n| 3/5 | 0,6 | 60% |\n| 4/5 | 0,8 | 80% |\n| 1/10 | 0,1 | 10% |\n| 1/8 | 0,125 | 12,5% |\n| 1/3 | 0,333… | 33⅓% |\n| 1/100 | 0,01 | 1% |"},{"title":"1. Diskon (Potongan harga)","content":"**Harga setelah diskon = harga awal × (100% − diskon%)**\n\nContoh: Baju Rp80.000, diskon 25%.\n→ Harga bayar = Rp80.000 × (100% − 25%) = Rp80.000 × 75% = Rp80.000 × 0,75 = **Rp60.000**.\n*Alternatif:* potongan = 25% × Rp80.000 = Rp20.000 → bayar = Rp80.000 − Rp20.000 = Rp60.000."},{"title":"2. Pajak / PPN (Tambahan harga)","content":"**Harga + pajak = harga awal × (100% + pajak%)**\n\nContoh: Barang Rp50.000, PPN 10%.\n→ Total bayar = Rp50.000 × 110% = Rp50.000 × 1,10 = **Rp55.000**."},{"title":"3. Bunga Sederhana (1 periode)","content":"**Bunga = % bunga × pokok simpanan**, lalu **total = pokok + bunga**.\n\nContoh: Tabungan Rp200.000, bunga 5% per tahun, setelah 1 tahun.\n→ Bunga = 5% × Rp200.000 = Rp10.000 → Total = Rp210.000."},{"title":"4. Persentase Statistik","content":"Untuk mencari persentase pilihan dalam survei: **(jumlah pemilih / total responden) × 100%**."},{"title":"5. Kenaikan / Pertumbuhan","content":"Bila sesuatu naik **K%**, nilai baru = nilai lama × (100% + K%).\nBila turun **T%**, nilai baru = nilai lama × (100% − T%)."},{"title":"E. Miskonsepsi yang Dihukum di Soal","content":"1. **Tertukar pembilang & penyebut.** \"15 dari 60\" sering ditulis (60/15)×100% = 400%. Yang dicari: bagian dibagi total, **bukan** total dibagi bagian.\n2. **Lupa kali 100%.** (15/60) = 0,25 lalu ditulis 0,25% — salah. Harus 25%.\n3. **Salah konversi.** 30% dianggap 30 (utuh), bukan 0,30. Akibatnya 30% dari 200 dihitung 30 × 200 = 6.000.\n4. **Diskon dihitung dari harga setelah diskon** (logika lingkar). Diskon selalu dari **harga awal**.\n5. **Persen ditambah kasar.** \"Naik 50%, lalu naik 50%\" dianggap naik 100%. Padahal kalau dihitung berlipat: 1,5 × 1,5 = 2,25 → naik **125%**.\n\n---"}],"questions":[{"number":1,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Berapa persen 20 dari 100?","options":{"A":"20%","B":"50%","C":"2%","D":"200%"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":2,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"25% dari 80 sama dengan ...","options":{"A":"15","B":"25","C":"20","D":"2"},"answerKey":"C","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":3,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"Berapa persen 15 dari 60?","options":{"A":"25%","B":"40%","C":"15%","D":"4%"},"answerKey":"A","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D":""},"steps":[],"tips":""},{"number":4,"subTopic":"Latihan","level":"Kab","question":"10% dari 500 adalah ...","options":{"A":"5","B":"50","C":"500","D":"5.000"},"answerKey":"B","concept":"","analysis":{"A":"","B":"","C":"","D